/* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
   exporter.js â€” Dynamic Interactive HTML & PDF Export Engine
â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

const Exporter = (() => {

  const TEMPLATE_BASE64 = "";

  function getBaseTemplate() {
    const binary = atob(TEMPLATE_BASE64);
    const bytes = new Uint8Array(binary.length);
    for (let i = 0; i < binary.length; i++) {
      bytes[i] = binary.charCodeAt(i);
    }
    return new TextDecoder('utf-8').decode(bytes);
  }

  function exportDynamicHTML(state) {
    if (!state || !state.analyticsData || !state.mergedProducts || !state.mergedProducts.length) {
      if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.toast) App.toast('Please generate or load a dashboard first.', 'err');
      return;
    }

    if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.showLoading) App.showLoading('Generating Standalone Dynamic HTML Dashboardâ€¦');

    setTimeout(() => {
      try {
        const marketName = state.dmMarketName || 'Defined Market';
        const periodName = state.analyticsData.summary?.periodName || 'Period';
        const periodLabel = state.analyticsData.summary?.periodLabel || 'H1 2026 vs. 2025';
        const safeMarketName = marketName.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_\u0600-\u06FF\s-]/g, '').trim().replace(/\s+/g, '_');
        const fileName = 'PharmaDash_' + safeMarketName + '_' + periodName.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_-]/g, '_') + '_Interactive.html';

        const payload = {
          dmMarketName: marketName,
          startMonth: state.startMonth,
          endMonth: state.endMonth,
          periodPreset: state.periodPreset,
          metric: state.metric,
          topN: state.topN,
          mergedProducts: state.mergedProducts,
          generatedAt: new Date().toISOString()
        };

        const jsonStr = JSON.stringify(payload).replace(/<\/script>/gi, '<\\/script>');
        let html = getBaseTemplate();

        html = html.replace(/\/\*%%PAYLOAD_JSON%%\*\/\{\}/g, jsonStr);
        html = html.replace(/%%MARKET_NAME%%/g, marketName);
        html = html.replace(/%%PERIOD_LABEL%%/g, periodLabel);
        html = html.replace(/%%PERIOD_NAME%%/g, periodName);

        const blob = new Blob([html], { type: 'text/html;charset=utf-8' });
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        const a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = url;
        a.download = fileName;
        document.body.appendChild(a);
        a.click();
        setTimeout(() => { a.remove(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url); }, 500);

        if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.hideLoading) App.hideLoading();
        if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.toast) {
          App.toast('Dynamic HTML saved: "' + fileName + '"! Completely standalone & interactive.', 'ok', 5500);
        }
      } catch (err) {
        if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.hideLoading) App.hideLoading();
        if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.toast) App.toast('Export error: ' + err.message, 'err', 5000);
        console.error(err);
      }
    }, 200);
  }

  function exportPDF(state) {
    const data = state ? state.analyticsData : (typeof App !== 'undefined' ? App.state.analyticsData : null);
    if (!data) {
      if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.toast) App.toast('No dashboard data available to export.', 'err');
      return;
    }

    const marketName = (state && state.dmMarketName) || (typeof App !== 'undefined' ? App.state.dmMarketName : null) || 'Defined Market';
    const periodLabel = data.summary?.periodLabel || 'Period Comparison';
    const safeMarketName = marketName.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_\u0600-\u06FF\s-]/g, '').trim().replace(/\s+/g, '_');
    const fileName = 'PharmaDash_' + safeMarketName + '_' + periodLabel.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_-]/g, '_') + '_Report.pdf';

    if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.showLoading) App.showLoading('Generating Executive PDF Reportâ€¦');

    setTimeout(() => {
      if (typeof html2pdf !== 'undefined') {
        const element = document.querySelector('.dash-main');
        if (!element) {
          if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.hideLoading) App.hideLoading();
          window.print();
          return;
        }

        let banner = document.getElementById('pdf-report-banner');
        if (!banner) {
          banner = document.createElement('div');
          banner.id = 'pdf-report-banner';
          banner.className = 'pdf-banner';
          banner.innerHTML = '<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 20px;background:#0d1424;border-bottom:2px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:18px;">' +
            '<div>' +
              '<div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#f1f5f9;letter-spacing:-0.5px">PharmaDash â€” Executive Market Intelligence</div>' +
              '<div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#60a5fa;margin-top:3px">' + marketName + '</div>' +
            '</div>' +
            '<div style="text-align:right">' +
              '<div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#34d399;background:rgba(52,211,153,0.12);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:14px;display:inline-block">' + periodLabel + '</div>' +
              '<div style="font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px">Generated: ' + (new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB')) + '</div>' +
            '</div>' +
          '</div>';
          element.prepend(banner);
        }

        const opt = {
          margin: [8, 8, 8, 8],
          filename: fileName,
          image: { type: 'jpeg', quality: 0.98 },
          html2canvas: {
            scale: 2,
            useCORS: true,
            backgroundColor: '#070c18',
            logging: false
          },
          jsPDF: { unit: 'mm', format: 'a4', orientation: 'landscape' },
          pagebreak: { mode: ['css', 'legacy'] }
        };

        html2pdf().set(opt).from(element).save().then(() => {
          if (banner) banner.remove();
          if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.hideLoading) App.hideLoading();
          if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.toast) App.toast('PDF Report downloaded successfully!', 'ok', 4000);
        }).catch(err => {
          if (banner) banner.remove();
          if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.hideLoading) App.hideLoading();
          console.warn('html2pdf fallback to window.print():', err);
          window.print();
        });
      } else {
        if (typeof App !== 'undefined' && App.hideLoading) App.hideLoading();
        window.print();
      }
    }, 200);
  }

  return {
    exportDynamicHTML,
    exportPDF
  };
})();

window.Exporter = Exporter;
if (typeof module !== 'undefined' && module.exports) {
  module.exports = Exporter;
}